---
// HOME SCOPE AUTHORITY SPLIT — major credibility section on operating boundaries. Built for the
// 2026-09-03 homepage composition rebuild (docs/05-DECISIONS-LOG.md, "Homepage section count
// reopened").
//
// WHY THIS COPY, NOT TSW/REGULATED-WASTE CONTENT. The task's design-system spec calls this slot
// "regulated / authority split" with a TSW / regulated-waste-pathway example. AGENTS.md §3 is
// explicit that TSW #933 content is "Published only on /crime-scene-trauma-cleanup-san-jose/ and
// its cross-links (footer, /services/, doc27ServicePages.ts)" — the homepage is not in that list,
// so this section cannot lead with TSW/trauma-waste material without a fresh owner decision this
// session does not have. It also cannot restore homepage.qualification/homepage.excludedScope:
// the 2026-09-03 "Homepage section count reopened" entry says outright "ConfidenceAndFit's
// exclusion list stays on /services/, not restored to the homepage." What this section uses
// instead is docs/aseptaclean-all-website-copy.md's "We do not pretend every problem belongs to
// us." passage — genuine, homepage-scoped, not rendered anywhere else on `/`, and exactly the
// kind of honest-boundary credibility content this slot calls for. Verbatim, unedited.
import EditorialSplit from "@components/EditorialSplit.astro";
import boundaryImage from "../assets/stock/equipment_gear.jpg";
---

<EditorialSplit
  eyebrow="What we handle"
  heading="We do not pretend every problem belongs to us."
  headingId="scope-authority-title"
  image={boundaryImage}
  imageAlt="Reference photograph of cleaning equipment and supplies staged for a project."
  imageSide="right"
  tone="warm"
>
  <p>
    Sometimes the right next step is not more cleaning. If we see something that appears to
    require pest control, structural repair, HVAC work, licensed contractor work, or another
    specialty outside our scope, we will tell you. Aseptaclean stays focused on the work we are
    there to perform.
  </p>
  <p class="home-scope-authority__statement">
    The goal is not to sell you every service. The goal is to identify the work the property
    actually needs.
  </p>
</EditorialSplit>

<style>
  .home-scope-authority__statement {
    color: var(--ac-color-navy-900);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
